echo $?` (stdout JSON envelope, exit 3), and `./splitwise-pp-cli balances --json --db /tmp/x.db` unchanged from before.
Report the list of files changed and each verification command's output in your final message.

## Additional edits from the code review (same task)
6. **splitwise_output.go `unwrapSingleArrayField`:** when counting candidate arrays, SKIP fields whose trimmed raw value is
   `null` or `[]`, and skip keys present in the generated `envelopeMetadataArrayKeys` / `envelopeMetadataKeys` maps
