Implemented the peer-review fixes using only hand-authored files under `internal/cli/`.

Key outcomes:

- All specified hand commands now use `emitStructured`.
- CSV/plain output respects `--select` and `--compact`.
- Nested objects and multi-array envelopes safely fall back to JSON instead of emitting `map[...]`.
- Empty/null and metadata arrays no longer block single-array projection.
- Machine-mode usage/not-found errors return typed JSON envelopes.
- Current-user sync hints name `sync --resources get-current-user`.
- Happy-args annotations and synthetic fixture names were corrected.
- Added comprehensive CSV/plain, annotation, selection, fallback, and exit-code tests.
- No eligible unwrapped error-return helpers remained.

Changed files:

```text
internal/cli/activity.go
internal/cli/audit.go
internal/cli/brief.go
internal/cli/emit_structured_test.go
internal/cli/exit_codes_test.go
internal/cli/fairness.go
internal/cli/fairness_nudge.go
internal/cli/forecast.go
internal/cli/hand_output_test.go
internal/cli/happy_args_test.go
internal/cli/ledger.go
internal/cli/ledger_test.go
internal/cli/net.go
internal/cli/normalize.go
internal/cli/reconcile.go
internal/cli/recurring.go
internal/cli/report.go
internal/cli/resolve.go
internal/cli/spend.go
internal/cli/split.go
internal/cli/splitwise_balances_bygroup_test.go
internal/cli/splitwise_output.go
```

Verification:

```text
$ go build ./...
success

$ go vet ./...
success

$ go test -count=1 ./internal/cli/
ok  splitwise-pp-cli/internal/cli  3.776s

$ go build -o ./splitwise-pp-cli ./cmd/splitwise-pp-cli
success
```

Requested binary demonstrations:

```text
$ ./splitwise-pp-cli net --csv --db /tmp/x.db
hint: local store has not been synced yet. Run 'splitwise-pp-cli sync' before trusting local results.
{"you_id":0,"by_currency":[],"plan":[],"savings":[]}
```

```text
$ ./splitwise-pp-cli ledger "Example Group" --json --db /tmp/x.db; echo $?
hint: local store has not been synced yet. Run 'splitwise-pp-cli sync' before trusting local results.
{"code":3,"error":"group \"Example Group\" not found; run sync or use a numeric id"}
3
```

```text
$ ./splitwise-pp-cli balances --json --db /tmp/x.db
hint: local store has not been synced yet. Run 'splitwise-pp-cli sync' before trusting local results.
{
  "by_currency": [],
  "friends": []
}
```
