Implemented the peer-review fixes using only hand-authored files under `internal/cli/`.

Key outcomes:

- All specified hand commands now use `emitStructured`.
- CSV/plain output respects `--select` and `--compact`.
- Nested objects and multi-array envelopes safely fall back to JSON instead of emitting `map[...]`.
- Empty/null and metadata arrays no longer block single-array projection.
- Machine-mode usage/not-found errors return typed JSON envelopes.
- Current-user sync hints name `sync --resources get-current-user`.
- Happy-args annotations and synthetic fixture names were corrected.
- Added comprehensive CSV/plain, annotation, selection, fallback, and exit-code tests.
- No eligible unwrapped error-return helpers remained.

